					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867554#post-4822846</guid>
				<title>SCP-5944: Re: Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867554/scp-5944#post-4822846</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2020 20:26:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Asdfaslas</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5335699</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I did a tiny little fix. You wrote:</p> <blockquote> <p>A full recovery from SCP-5944’s cognitohazardous effects are possible, but highly variable.</p> </blockquote> <p>But it should be &quot;is possible&quot; not &quot;are possible&quot; because the thing that is possible is &quot;a full recovery&quot; (singular) not &quot;cognitohazardous effects&quot; (plural)</p> <p>So I've already gone in and fixed it, but since you said it's your first time I wanted to also pop in and explain the reason for it in detail so that you'd know why someone changed your words.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
