					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867893#post-4822841</guid>
				<title>The Resurrector: Quick Critique</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867893/the-resurrector#post-4822841</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2020 20:20:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Iamwords2E</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5274191</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Format is confusing, you don't need to press enter every 2 lines that is just not how paragraphs work. Labeling of the instances is confusing, SCP-5127-2 and SCP-5127-3 could have their designations switched and it would flow better. Sentences are to simple and could be worded better so they are not as awkward. The SCP itself has little meat to and could use some plot (doesn't have to be a heavy one though) since at this point it is just the Necronomicon. You definitely have room for improvement but your asking for help is good sign. Though it is not recommended that you post articles on the main site of critique; <a href="http://http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/">The Wiki Sandbox</a> in which drafts are posted for critique by designated wiki staff. Though I will warn you that it will likely be slow to hear a response though they are one of the better at giving critique that most other sources (even me). I hope this helps.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13867893#post-4822836</guid>
